{"municipality_code":"03303","pref":"岩手県","city":"岩手町","headline":"街道の街の雰囲気が感じられ、村の境界の痕跡も見つかるかもしれません。","display_comment_enriched":"岩手町には、沼宮内村、新町村、江刈内村など、近世の村々の記憶を伝える地名が残っています。 周辺には史跡や遺跡、寺社や信仰の場、古墳や貝塚にまつわる場所が点在し、「川口II遺跡」、「仙波堤遺跡」、「豊岡遺跡」などを起点に歩くと、地域の歴史がぐっと見えやすくなります。 現地では史跡説明板に加え、沼宮内村や新町村にゆかりのある旧境石標、村の歴史を紹介する案内板にも注目してみてください。 川沿いや水辺では、暮らしや堤防整備の歴史を伝える案内板、治水碑、河川改修の記念碑にも注目してみてください。 人物に目を向けるなら、武将・武士の南部信直との縁をたどることで、街の歴史をより立体的に楽しめます。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":49,"rank":856,"percentile":54.6,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":48,"rank":493,"percentile":73.3,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":15,"rank":491,"percentile":71.6,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":1,"rank":1372,"percentile":15.9,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":5,"rank":804,"percentile":50.9,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":2,"rank":320,"percentile":69.8,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":15,"rank":946,"percentile":48.0,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_people":["南部信直","工藤孝一","